:Class Client
    ⍝ Quotations - Version 1.0.0
    ⍝ Prepare, revise and withdraw quotations for office supplies from a fixed catalogue.

    :field public ∆ ⍝ Client specific "stuff"
    :field public products ⍝ products tag
    :field public quotes ⍝ quotes tag

    ∇ ∆make config
        :Access public
        :Implements constructor
        :If 0=config.⎕NC'baseUrl'
            ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 11)('Message' 'Missing required parameter: baseUrl')
        :EndIf

        ∆←()
        ∆.config←⎕NS config
        ∆.config.mock←∆.config ⎕VGET ⊂'mock' ¯1 ⍝ ¯1 by default. 1 means return the raw HTTP request. 2 means return the namespace that would be sent to HttpCommand.
        ∆.Debug←0 ⍝ Set to 1 to log the raw HTTP request sent to the server. Not compatible with mock=2

        ∆.Cookies←⍬

        ⍝ Some utility functions
        ∆.utils←⎕NS (⊃∊⎕CLASS ⎕THIS).##.utils
        ∆.utils.c←⎕THIS

        ∆.Version←(⊃∊⎕CLASS ⎕THIS).##.Version

        ∆.HttpCommand←(⊃∊⎕CLASS ⎕THIS).##.HttpCommand

        ⍝ Initialize all tag namespaces
        products←⎕NS (⊃∊⎕CLASS ⎕THIS).##._tags.products
        products.c←⎕THIS

        quotes←⎕NS (⊃∊⎕CLASS ⎕THIS).##._tags.quotes
        quotes.c←⎕THIS
    ∇
:EndClass